give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Nobody Fucking Move\"", "italic": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Snake Charmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose an alive player: a chosen Demon swaps characters & alignments with you & is then poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Alsaahir", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, if you publicly guess which players are Minion(s) and which are Demon(s), good wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Slayer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, during the day, publicly choose a player: if they are the Demon, they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Philosopher", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a good character: gain that ability. If this character is in play, they are drunk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Alchemist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have a Minion ability. When using this, the Storyteller may prompt you to choose differently."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Virgin", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe 1st time you are nominated, if the nominator is a Townsfolk, they are executed immediately."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Heretic", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhoever wins, loses & whoever loses, wins, even if you are dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Damsel", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nAll Minions know a Damsel is in play. If a Minion publicly guesses you (once), your team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Klutz", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you learn that you died, publicly choose 1 alive player: if they are evil, your team loses."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Psychopath", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach day, before nominations, you may publicly choose a player: they die. If executed, you only die if you lose roshambo."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Goblin", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf you publicly claim to be the Goblin when nominated & are executed that day, your team wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Boomdandy", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf you are executed, all but 3 players die. After a 10 to 1 countdown, the player with the most players pointing at them, dies."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pukka", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: they are poisoned. The previously poisoned player dies then becomes healthy."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Vortox", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. Townsfolk abilities yield false info. Each day, if no-one is executed, evil wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sentinel", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nThere might be 1 extra or 1 fewer Outsider in play."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Duchess", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nEach day, 3 players may choose to visit you. At night*, each visitor learns how many visitors are evil, but 1 gets false info."]],title:"Nobody Fucking Move Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Nobody Fucking Move Script", "italic": false, "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Nobody Fucking Move\"", "italic": false, "color": "dark_red"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]